<title>USA: Triad Systems stake cut by Gabelli group.</title>
<headline>Triad Systems stake cut by Gabelli group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Wednesday it reduced its stake in Triad Systems Corp to 7.63 percent or 1,361,000 common shares of the company's 17,835,409 outstanding shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 162,700 shares between Jan. 22 and Feb. 3 at prices ranging from $9.3747 to $9.6250 per share.</p>
